  "details": "Description\n\nso it happens with every avatar with certain animation, not just the ones i have uploaded- after crouching with the Y key (or Z in american), the animation for courching/getting up is completely wrong and then when my avatar stand they are crooked or leaning forward. i am desktop only, it happens with and without webcam tracking. it started some time today during play i dont know what triggered it. i also emptied cache and restarted vrchat and nothing changed\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nsadly i dont know what caused it i am so damn sorry it happened in the avatar testing chamber thats all i know. i used AFK animation fore the first time today and adjusted my height to another users eye height but idk if one of these caused it \n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Avatar\n\n- Frequency: Once\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p2-1938-565822d00a-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-11_20-42-07.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_de467ac4-e3ea-455a-8811-47d154aaaa84/1/file)",
